Subject: [PATCH] 958: one latency line per answer, stored -> run -> answer

The tester's small talk took 5.5-6.5 s while the model run took 1.6-2.7 s;
stored message to stored reply was 3.6-4.7 s, and the ~2 s around the run
was logged nowhere. Each answer now logs stored->run, run->answer and the
total. Log only; resumed runs (no stored time) log nothing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
